#
# Well-formed: a math:Theorem carrying a theory context (math:roleInTheory) and warranted
# by an in-graph math:Proof (math:provesStatement it). Theorem-hood is a theory-scoped,
# proof-backed role, not a truth bit. Conforms to math:TheoremGroundingShape.
# Bound by ex:ecTheoremGrounded.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:groundedTheorem a math:Theorem ;
    math:roleInTheory ex:euclideanGeometryV2 .

ex:groundedTheoremProof a math:Proof ;
    math:provesStatement ex:groundedTheorem .
